
AI‑Geometry‑Visualizer — Interactive Geometry Rendering & AI‑Based Shape Analysis

AI‑Geometry‑Visualizer is an interactive engine that renders geometric shapes, visualizes relationships, and applies lightweight AI logic to interpret angles, distances, and structural properties. It is designed for educational tools, geometry tutors, and systems that require dynamic diagram visualization.

---

📂 Project Structure
`
AI-Geometry-Visualizer/
├── python/
│   ├── visualizer.py           # main visualization engine
│   ├── geometry_core.py        # points, lines, angles, polygons
│   ├── ai_analyzer.py          # AI-based relationship detection
│   └── demo.py                 # example usage
│
├── java/
│   └── Main.java               # Java version (console or simple GUI)
│
└── README.md                   # documentation
